### 1. Check backend
GET http://localhost:5000/

###

### 2. Get campus services
GET http://localhost:5000/api/services

###

### 3. Register a student
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Student",
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "Student123!"
}

###

### 4. Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "Student123!"
}

###

### 5. Book an appointment
# Replace YOUR_TOKEN with the token from a successful login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MSwiZW1haWwiOiJzdHVkZW50QGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwicm9sZSI6InN0dWRlbnQiLCJpYXQiOjE3OTMwODM2MDMsImV4cCI6MTc5MzA5MDgwM30.IA3UBjJdv0ySXD7rUQSHWg0zjPMuliicR8sLkq6jKLo

{
  "service": "IT Support",
  "slot": "2026-10-28 10:00 AM"
